{"ref":"BDB, יַבְנְאֵל","hw":"יַבְנְאֵל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יַבְנְאֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc. (</strong><em>E†l causeth to build</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, בְּנָיָ֫הוּ\" href=\"/BDB,_בְּנָיָ֫הוּ\", dir=\"rtl\">בניהו</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, יַבְנֶה\" href=\"/BDB,_יַבְנֶה\", dir=\"rtl\">יַבְנֶה</a><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  town in Judah <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:11\" href=\"/Joshua.15.11\">Jos 15:11</a> (𝔊L Ἰαβνηλ) = <span dir=\"rtl\">יַבְנֶה</span> (q.v.) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.6\">2 Ch 26:6</a>; = Gk. <em>Iamnia,</em> mod. Yebna Bd<sup>Pal. 161</sup>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  town in Naphtali <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:33\" href=\"/Joshua.19.33\">Jos 19:33</a>.","next":"BDB, יַבְנֶה","prev":"BDB, בִּנְיָן"}